   "title": "HD Construction Equipment, veterans ministry unveil Korean War memorial in Ethiopia",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/others/20261111/hd-construction-equipment-veterans-ministry-unveil-korean-war-memorial-in-ethiopia",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
