   "title": "Hana Financial kicks off annual volunteering campaign with kimchi-making event",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/banking-finance/20261111/hana-financial-kicks-off-annual-volunteering-campaign-with-kimchi-making-event",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
