   "title": "From pork to tangerines: 3 foods to try on Jeju autumn trip",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/lifestyle/travel-food/20261111/from-pork-to-tangerines-3-foods-to-try-on-jeju-autumn-trip",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
