   "title": "Rail workers threaten indefinite strike from Dec. 10",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/20261111/rail-workers-threaten-indefinite-strike-from-dec-10",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
