   "summary": "Dangote Cement Plc, has rescinded plan to list its shares on the London Stock Exchange, LSE following market conditions. “Dangote Cement PLC remains focused on delivering sustainable value to its shareholders and building on its strong market position.” It will be recalled that Dangote had disclosed plans to list the cement business on the London Stock Exchange in May, eight years after an earlier attempt in 2018 failed.",
   "summary_zh": "受市场状况影响， Dangote Cement Plc已取消其股票在伦敦证券交易所上市的计划。Damco Cement PLC表示：“Dangote Cement PLC仍专注于为股东创造可持续价值，并巩固其强大的市场地位。”此前，Damco曾披露计划于今年5月在伦敦证券交易所上市其水泥业务；这是继2018年上一次尝试失败后时隔八年的再次尝试。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Dangote Cement Plc, has rescinded plan to list its shares on the London Stock Exchange, LSE following market conditions. The company disclosed this after its Board Meeting held on Tuesday. “ The company’s ordinary shares remain listed on the NGX, and this decision does not in any way affect the company’s operations or business plans. “Dangote Cement PLC remains focused on delivering sustainable value to its shareholders and building on its strong market position.” It will be recalled that Dangote had disclosed plans to list the cement business on the London Stock Exchange in May, eight years after an earlier attempt in 2018 failed. He had told the Financial Times that the proposed dual listing would involve selling about 10 percent of Dangote Cement’s shares on the UK exchange. Comments expressed here do not reflect the opinions of Vanguard newspapers or any employee thereof",
