   "title": "3 Feared Killed As Gunmen Attack Mining Site In Plateau",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/3-feared-killed-as-gunmen-attack-mining-site-in-plateau/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
   "source": "Leadership（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:53:03 +0000",
   "_dt": 1794376383.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "The incident occurred at about 6pm on Tuesday, when the assailants reportedly stormed the mining site and opened fire on people in the area. A resident of the community, Bulus Shen, who confirmed the incident, told newsmen that the gunmen arrived at the mining site in the evening and began shooting sporadically. Shen said the attack threw the community into panic, adding that three people were reportedly killed in the incident.",
   "summary_zh": "事件发生于周二晚上6点左右，据报道，袭击者冲入矿区并向附近人员开枪。证实此事的大社区居民Bulus Shen向记者表示，枪手傍晚抵达矿区并开始零星射击。Shen说，这次袭击使社区陷入恐慌，据报道事件造成3人死亡。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The incident occurred at about 6pm on Tuesday, when the assailants reportedly stormed the mining site and opened fire on people in the area. A resident of the community, Bulus Shen, who confirmed the incident, told newsmen that the gunmen arrived at the mining site in the evening and began shooting sporadically. Shen said the attack threw the community into panic, adding that three people were reportedly killed in the incident. The spokesperson of the Berom Youth Moulders Association (BYM), Rwang Tengwong, also confirmed the attack. Tengwong condemned the killing, describing the incident as disturbing and unacceptable. He called on security agencies to urgently investigate the attack, apprehend those responsible and strengthen security around rural communities to prevent further loss of life. Meanwhile, efforts to get further details from the Public Relations Officer, Plateau State Police Command, DSP Alfred Alabo, were unsuccessful at the time of filing this report. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates → Join Our WhatsApp Channel --> --> Achor Abimaje Achor Abimaje is a Senior Correspondent with Leadership Newspaper, recognised for human-angle reporting, investigative journalism, and conflict reporting. He is known for his nose for news and exclusives, sound reportorial judgement, and a commitment to balancing accuracy with speed through disciplined fact-checking",
