   "title": "Korea to launch task force to tackle disparities",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261111/korea-to-launch-task-force-to-tackle-disparities",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:47:03 GMT",
   "_dt": 1794365223.0,
   "ageDays": 0.14,
   "summary": "Korea will launch a new task force led by the finance minister to address widening disparities across various sectors, the government said Wednesday. Finance Minister Lee Hyoung-il unveiled the plan during a meeting with economy-related ministers, saying the task force will consist of five working groups tasked with addressing disparities in the labor market, industries, regions, generations and social classes.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国政府周三表示，将成立一个由财政部长牵头的新工作组，以应对各领域日益扩大的差距。财政部长李 Hyoung-il 在与经济部门部长举行的会议上公布了这项计划，称工作组将由5个工作小组组成，分别负责处理劳动力市场、产业、地区、世代和社会阶层之间的差距。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Korea will launch a new task force led by the finance minister to address widening disparities across various sectors, the government said Wednesday. Finance Minister Lee Hyoung-il unveiled the plan during a meeting with economy-related ministers, saying the task force will consist of five working groups tasked with addressing disparities in the labor market, industries, regions, generations and social classes. Each group will be led by a vice minister responsible for the respective area and work with state-run research institutes to identify key policy tasks. \"The artificial intelligence transformation could deepen and accelerate disparities, leading to a K-shaped divide,\" the government said. The working groups will officially launch Thursday, with each set to report its detailed goals to the task force by early December. Key policy agendas will be reflected in Korea's economic growth plan for 2027",
