   "title": "Senate Passes Bill to Bring Big Fintechs, Non-Bank Financial Institutions Under CBN Regulation",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/11/10/senate-passes-bill-to-bring-big-fintechs-non-bank-financial-institutions-under-cbn-regulation-2/",
