   "title": "Abuja NUJ Wins Gold at 8th Nigeria-China Table Tennis Friendship Tournament",
   "url": "https://www.thegazellenews.com/abuja-nuj-wins-gold-at-8th-nigeria-china-table-tennis-friendship-tournament",
