   "title": "Korean won gains against US dollar as oil prices slide",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261110/korean-won-gains-against-us-dollar-as-oil-prices-slide",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
