   "_dt": 1794224977.0,
   "ageDays": 1.77,
   "summary": "Minister of State in charge of Government Communications, Felix Kwakye Ofosu, says the government will introduce a comprehensive four-year economic transformation plan, dubbed the New Economy, through the 2027 Budget Statement and Economic Policy. The plan will be presented by Finance Minister Dr Cassiel Ato Forson when he delivers the 2027 Budget to Parliament on Thursday, November 12, 2026.",
   "summary_zh": "负责政府传播事务的部长Felix Kwakye Ofosu表示，政府将通过2027年预算声明和经济政策推出全面实施四年期的经济转型计划，名为“新经济”。财政部长Cassiel Ato Forson博士将于2026年11月12日星期四向议会提交2027年预算时介绍该计划。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Minister of State in charge of Government Communications, Felix Kwakye Ofosu, says the government will introduce a comprehensive four-year economic transformation plan, dubbed the New Economy, through the 2027 Budget Statement and Economic Policy. The plan will be presented by Finance Minister Dr Cassiel Ato Forson when he delivers the 2027 Budget to Parliament on Thursday, November 12, 2026. In a Facebook post, Mr Kwakye Ofosu said the initiative would involve major investments in the productive sectors of the economy as part of a broader strategy to transform the country's economy over the next four years. He did not provide details of the specific sectors or investments to be covered under the plan. The Minister also disclosed that refurbishment works on Terminal 2 of the Accra International Airport are 80 per cent complete",
