   "title": "US military officials visit HD Hyundai shipyard to assess shipbuilding capabilities",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/defense/20261108/us-military-officials-visit-hd-hyundai-shipyard-to-assess-shipbuilding-capabilities",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
