   "title": "Defense committee chair says OPCON agreement stands despite US midterm outcome",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261108/defense-committee-chair-says-opcon-agreement-stands-despite-us-midterm-outcome",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
