   "title": "2027 Elections: 70 Attacks, 27 Dead As Political Violence Escalates",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/2027-elections-70-attacks-27-dead-as-political-violence-escalates-centresgd/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
